\**{c=red:Note:}** If you have sufficient time, you may consider pairing this Mission with your level 60 Limit Break {q:Whence Blows the Wind|Whence Blows the Wind|Whence Blows the Wind}, as you have to visit the same three zones. However, {q:Whence Blows the Wind|Whence Blows the Wind|Whence Blows the Wind} objectives take significantly more time to complete than the objectives of this Mission. If you examine the {p:Survival Guides|Survival Guide} in the area, you can easily come back to the zones later.{br} {br} **{c=red:*This Mission is identical for all three }{z:Nations}{c=red:. If you have completed this mission in another nation, you will }**{c=red:not}**{c=red: have to complete the prerequisite quests again, as the Key Items are saved, you will only need to re-obtain the Magicites.}**
=2 Walkthrough
!Magicite.jpg|right|
First head to a {p:Conquest Overseer} either in your home city or {p:Jeuno}. Trade them enough Crystals (4+), until your Rank bar is almost or completely full.
* To flag the Mission, speak with {n:Nelcabrit}, then click the **Door: San d'Orian Emb.** in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} (G-10) for the {@k} {k:Archducal audience permit}.
** The 3rd door on the left in the **San d'Orian Embassy** is the correct one.
* Click on the **Door: Audience Chamber** in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} (H-5) for a cutscene and the {@k} {k:Letter to Aldo}.
* Speak to {n:Aldo} in {z:Lower Jeuno}, in the back of the **Neptune's Spire** Tenshodo H.Q. for a cutscene and the {@k} {k:Silver bell}.
** If you have done this mission in another Nation then you already have the bell, but you still need to talk to him for a cutscene.
* Obtain the 3 Magicite Key Items. **See below for details**.
* Click the **Audience Chamber** in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} (H-5) after obtaining all 3 Magicites for a cutscene and your reward (either an {@k} {k:Airship Pass}, or, if you already have one, 20,000 Gil).
* Return to {n:Nelcabrit} in the **San d'Orian Embassy** to complete the mission, receive 10,000 Gil and {@k} {k:Message to Jeuno (San d'Oria)}.

=2 Prerequisite Quests
\**Note:** With {s:Tractor} and a friend who has all of the Key Items, the only Key Items that is necessary are {@k} {k:Silver bell} and {@k} {k:Yagudo torch}.{br} This mission is identical for all three {z:Nations}. If you have completed this mission in another nation, you will **not** have to complete the prerequisite quests again, as the Key Items are saved, you will only need to obtain the Magicites.
=4 Tenshodo
* Gain access to the {p:Tenshodo} by completing the quest {q:Tenshodo Membership|Tenshodo Membership|Tenshodo Membership} if you have enough {q:fame|Fame|fame}.
** Buy a {i:Tenshodo Invite|Tenshodo Invite|548} from the {z:Auction House} and trade it to {n:Ghebi Damomohe} inside Neptune's Spire in {z:Lower Jeuno}.
* Examine the door at the end of the hallway in **Neptune's Spire** to enter the Tenshodo H.Q.
* Once inside speak with {n:Aldo} (J-8) for the {@k} {k:Silver bell}.

=4 Key Items
* {@k} {k:Yagudo torch}:
** Speak to {n:Paya-Sabya} in {z:Upper Jeuno} (I-8) and then {n:Muckvix} (H-9) inside **Muckvix's Junk Shop** in {z:Lower Jeuno} for the torch.
* {@k} {k:Coruscant rosary} and {@k} {k:Black matinee necklace}:
** Speak to {n:Sattal-Mansal} in {z:Lower Jeuno} (J-8) behind the **Tenshodo Guild Doors** to start the quests {q:Mysteries of Beadeaux I|Mysteries of Beadeaux I|Mysteries of Beadeaux I} and {q:Mysteries of Beadeaux II|Mysteries of Beadeaux II|Mysteries of Beadeaux II}, then trade him the {i:Quadav Charm|Quadav Charm|495} and {i:Quadav Augury Shell|Qdv. Augury Shell|494}.
*** Note: These are **separate** quests and therefore you must trade each item **separately** to obtain both required key items.
* {@k} {p:Crest of Davoi}:
** Speak with {n:Baudin} in {z:Upper Jeuno} (G-8), trade him a {i:Coeurl Meat|Coeurl Meat|4377}. You can buy one from the {z:Auction House} or farm one from a {p:Coeurl} in {z:Sauromugue Champaign} or {z:Meriphataud Mountains}.

=4 Maps
Before you head out, if you haven't already bought your maps, now is the time to do it. They can be purchased for 3,000 Gil from the following NPCs:
* {n:Elesca} - {z:Northern San d'Oria} (I-8)
* {n:Violitte} - {z:Southern San d'Oria} (G-10)
* {n:Karine} - {z:Bastok Markets} (H-9)
* {n:Rex} - {z:Port Bastok} (J-7)
* {n:Mhoji Roccoruh} - {z:Port Windurst} (G-9)
* {n:Pehki Machumaht} - {z:Windurst Woods} (H-11)
* {n:Promurouve} - {z:Lower Jeuno} (H-7)
* {n:Rusese} - {z:Upper Jeuno} (H-6)

=4 Beadeaux (Prerequisite)
\**Note:** This prerequisite can be done either __before or after__ the {z:Davoi} and {z:Castle Oztroja} sections of this mission. It's up to you whether you want to get the requisite {p:Key Items|Key Item} now, or in concert with the {z:Beadeaux} section.
* Mages will need {i:Echo Drops|Echo Drops|4151} for this area.
** {z:Beadeaux} has a gimmick whereby you must inflict {p:Silence} upon yourself when passing through certain sections to stop yourself being Cursed, {p:Curse} will decrease your HP/MP and cause you to walk slower.
* Everything in this area aggros sound, therefore only {s:Sneak} is necessary.
* Set your {p:Home Point} in {p:Jeuno} and bring some form of {p:Warp}. (You may purchase {i:Scroll of Instant Warp|Scroll of Instant Warp|4181} from the {p:Conquest NPC} under Common all-rank items for 10 points.)
* You will have to kill two level 40-45 {p:NM} in this zone. Having {p:trusts|Trust} summoned before applying {s:Sneak} and heading out is recommended.
* Enter {z:Beadeaux} from {z:Pashhow Marshlands} (L-11).
** If you have a high level helper it is easier at this point to send them ahead to kill the {p:NM's|NM} and then just lot the drops. If this is the case you can head back to {p:Jeuno} as soon as you have both items.
** You may also consider leveling to 60 (which is most likely your current cap).
* Follow the left wall to a tunnel at (H-7).
* Inside follow the right wall until you get to a **Mute** device inside a circular room. The __Mute__ has an effervescent glow and appears like a huge mushroom. Click this device and it will {p:silence|Silence} you. This will allow you to pass the up coming **Afflictor** without being {p:Cursed|Curse}.
* Head south after you have been silenced and then follow the tunnel west until you reach the exit at (F-8).
* Outside reapply silence at the **Mute** in front of you (There is another __Afflictor__ in this area) and then head southwest to a ramp at (E-10).
* Once you are on the upper area turn right and go across the bridge. Follow this path across a second and a third bridge then remove your silence. Follow the right wall here until you reach (H-9/10).
* Here you will find {p:De'Vyu Headhunter}. He is a {p:Warrior} {p:NM}. He will drop the {i:Quadav Charm|Quadav Charm|495}.
* Now turn around and head northeast back toward where you came from.
* Follow the right wall now until you reach (F-6).
* Here you will find {m:Go'Bhu Gascon}, another {p:Warrior} {p:NM}. He will drop the other required item, {i:Quadav Augury Shell|Qdv. Augury Shell|494}.
* Head back to {p:Jeuno}.
* Trade both items to {n:Sattal-Mansal}.
** These **__must**__ be traded separately through the use of two trades.
** **If you trade him both items at once you will not get both of the {p:KIs|KI} you need to open the door in the {z:Qulun Dome}. The second item will still be in your inventory.**

=2 Magicites
=3 Davoi Magicite
__This part of the mission can be soloed but a group or high level help will make death less likely.__ {br}{br} You will need to reach the {z:Monastic Cavern} in {z:Davoi}. Davoi is located in {z:Jugner Forest} (G-12).
* Make your way to {z:Davoi}.
* Once you've entered, head to (G-7).
** There will be two Orcs here - either kill them or sneak past them.
* Drop invisible and click on the **Wall of Dark Arts**, you'll be able to enter the {z:Monastic Cavern}.
** If you aggro the Orcs you can quickly run through the Wall to the zone a few feet ahead.
* Inside there will not be any enemies. Walk down the path into a large room and inspect the **Magicite** to obtain the {@k} {k:Magicite: Optistone}.

